msgid "In the FlexDesigner"
msgstr "FlexDesigner で"

#: ../../source/functions/device_control/flexbar_sleep.md:11
msgid ""
"Other than the standard visual options, this key doesn't have any additional"
" configurable functions in the FlexDesigner."
msgstr "標準のビジュアル オプション以外に、このキーには FlexDesigner で追加の構成可能な機能はありません。"

#: ../../source/functions/device_control/flexbar_sleep.md:13
msgid "On the Flexbar"
msgstr "Flexbar 上で"

#: ../../source/functions/device_control/flexbar_sleep.md:15
msgid "Press the key to put the device into sleep mode."
msgstr "キーを押してデバイスをスリープ モードにします。"
